+two timestamp assignments, duplicate off/on, gap absent/present, and every
+proper subset of non-gap peer identities. A gap fills on pass 2; passes 1, 2,
+and 3 are asserted as prefixes. Each six-object set contains two competing
+lease tuples, a losing-lease event branch, a Tombstone and matching
+Acknowledgement; every case also tries a same-identity/different-byte branch.
